xt-align:center\">Sent with GoFox CRM · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#98A2B3\">Unsubscribe</a></p>\n</td></tr></table></body></html>","plain_text":"Hi {{first_name}},\n\nThanks for the conversation about {{deal_name}}.\n\nYou wanted a rollout that does not disrupt {{company_name}}. I have a two-week pilot plan ready.\n\nIs {{suggested_time}} still workable?\n\n{{owner_name}}\n{{owner_title}} · GoFox","builder":"design","created_at":"2026-11-18T19:03:01.326Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T19:03:01.326Z"}','127.0.0.1','2026-11-18T19:03:01.336Z');
